/**
 * Validate all games:
 * - JSON schema validation (AJV). If AJV not installed, prints guidance.
 * - Iframe precheck (only allow 1games.io, pass XFO/CSP checks).
 * - Local game must contain index.html.
 * Exits with code 1 on any failure.
